#: ../../zh/release_note.md:26
msgid "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend 3.2.0"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:28
msgid "**首次发布：Ascend NPU 支持**"
msgstr "**First Release: Ascend NPU Support**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:30
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 是第一个正式支持华为 Ascend NPU 的 Triton 版本。此版本基于 Triton 3.2.0 "
"社区版本，专门适配 Ascend NPU 硬件架构。"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend 3.2.0 is the first Triton release to officially support Huawei"
" Ascend NPU. This version is based on the Triton 3.2.0 community release and"
" is specifically adapted to the Ascend NPU hardware architecture."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:32
msgid "主要特性"
msgstr "Key Features"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:34
msgid "**Ascend NPU 全栈支持**"
msgstr "**Full-Stack Support for Ascend NPU**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:35
msgid "完整的 Triton IR 到 NPU 指令集编译流水线"
msgstr "Complete Triton IR to NPU instruction set compilation pipeline"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:36
msgid "支持全部 Triton Ops"
msgstr "Supports all Triton Ops."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:38
msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:39
msgid "NPU 特定内核优化"
msgstr "NPU-specific kernel optimization"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:40
msgid "CV 计算优化"
msgstr "CV computation optimization"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:42
msgid "**开发者工具**"
msgstr "**Developer Tools**"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:43
msgid "支持全面的调试输出"
msgstr "Supports comprehensive debug output."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:44
msgid "编译中间产物转储"
msgstr "Compilation intermediate artifact dump"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:46
msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known Limitations"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:48
msgid "**数据类型**: 部分数据类型支持仍在完善中"
msgstr "**Data Types**: Support for some data types is still being refined."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:49
msgid "**算子覆盖**: 正在持续扩展支持的算子集合"
msgstr ""
"**Operator Coverage**: The set of supported operators is continuously "
"expanding."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:51
msgid "迁移指南"
msgstr "Migration Guide"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:53
msgid ""
"对于现有 Triton GPU 用户迁移到 Ascend NPU，详见 [GPU "
"Triton算子迁移](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md)"
msgstr ""
"For existing Triton GPU users migrating to Ascend NPU, see [GPU Triton "
"Operator Migration](./migration_guide/migrate_from_gpu.md) for details."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:55
msgid "版本发布策略"
msgstr "Release Versioning Strategy"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:57
msgid "版本编号"
msgstr "Version number"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:59
msgid ""
"Triton-Ascend 遵循 [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) 版本规范，版本号与上游 "
"Triton 对齐：`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"
msgstr ""
"Triton-Ascend follows the [PEP 440](https://peps.python.org/pep-0440/) "
"version specification, with version numbers aligned with upstream Triton: "
"`vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH[rcN][.postN]`"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:61
msgid ""
"**MAJOR.MINOR**：与上游 Triton 版本一一对应，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2` 基于 Triton `3.2`"
msgstr ""
"**MAJOR.MINOR**: Corresponds one-to-one with the upstream Triton version. "
"For example, Triton-Ascend `3.2` is based on Triton `3.2`."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:62
msgid ""
"**PATCH**：Triton-Ascend 的 `PATCH` 版本可能高于上游 Triton，用于 `MAJOR.MINOR` "
"级别的问题修复或改进，例如 Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` 和 `3.2.1` 均基于 Triton `3.2.0`"
msgstr ""
"**PATCH**: The `PATCH` version of Triton-Ascend may be higher than the "
"upstream Triton, used for issue fixes or improvements at the `MAJOR.MINOR` "
"level. For example, both Triton-Ascend `3.2.0` and `3.2.1` are based on "
"Triton `3.2.0`."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:63
msgid "**rcN**：发布候选版本，根据需要发布以供社区早期测试和反馈"
msgstr ""
"**rcN**: Release candidate version, released as needed for early community "
"testing and feedback."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:64
msgid "**postN**：已发布版本的后续补丁，根据需要发布以修复稳定版本中的问题"
msgstr ""
"**postN**: A subsequent patch to a released version, issued as needed to fix"
" issues in the stable release."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:66
msgid "分支策略"
msgstr "Branching strategy"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:68
msgid "`main` 分支为最新开发分支，跟踪最新上游 Triton 版本"
msgstr ""
"`main` branch is the latest development branch, tracking the latest upstream"
" Triton version."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:69
msgid "每个发布版本创建对应的发布开发分支（如 `release/3.2.x`），与社区发布具有相同的 commit id"
msgstr ""
"Each release version creates a corresponding release development branch "
"(e.g., `release/3.2.x`), which shares the same commit ID as the community "
"release."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:70
msgid "功能开发应在 fork 仓库中进行，通过 `PR` 合入 Triton-Ascend 仓库"
msgstr ""
"Feature development should be carried out in a forked repository and merged "
"into the Triton-Ascend repository via a `PR`."

