#: ../../zh/release_note.md:78
msgid "维护分支与生命周期"
msgstr "Maintenance branches and lifecycle."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:80
msgid "维护分支状态包括："
msgstr "Maintaining branch status includes:"

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:82
msgid "**活跃（Active）**：持续接受缺陷修复、功能改进和安全补丁；将继续演进功能或发布新版本"
msgstr ""
"**Active**: Continuously receives bug fixes, feature improvements, and "
"security patches; will continue to evolve features or release new versions."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:83
msgid "**维护（Maintenance）**：仅接受关键缺陷修复和安全补丁；不再发布功能改进"
msgstr ""
"**Maintenance**: Only critical bug fixes and security patches are accepted; "
"no feature improvements will be released."

#: ../../zh/release_note.md:84
msgid "**停止维护（End of Life）**：不再接受任何修复；分支维护已停止"
msgstr ""
"**End of Life**: No further fixes will be accepted; branch maintenance has "
"ceased."

